<p>Welcome to recuerd0!</p>

<p>Your account is ready. recuerd0 is a knowledge base for your AI workflows — organize, version, and serve project context to any LLM.</p>

<p><strong>What you can do:</strong></p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Workspaces</strong> — organize memories by project or topic</li>
  <li><strong>Memories</strong> — save context with full markdown, tagging, and versioning</li>
  <li><strong>Search</strong> — find anything with full-text search across all your content</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Where to start:</strong></p>

<p>We created <strong>My Workspace</strong> for you with four seeded memories: _MAP, Continuation Brief, _INDEX — Decisions, and a first decision, D001. The <%= link_to "Getting Started guide", start_url %> takes you from zero to your first import in a few minutes.</p>

<p><strong>Developer tools:</strong></p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>REST API</strong> — programmatic access with personal access tokens</li>
  <li><strong>CLI</strong> — manage workspaces and memories from the terminal</li>
  <li><strong>AI Agents</strong> — integrate recuerd0 as a context source for your AI tools</li>
</ul>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <% if @start_here_workspace %>
    <a href="<%= workspace_url(@start_here_workspace) %>" class="btn">Open My Workspace</a>
  <% else %>
    <a href="<%= workspaces_url %>" class="btn">Go to Workspaces</a>
  <% end %>
</p>

<p class="muted">Your data belongs to you. We will never share it, sell it, or use it to train AI models.</p>
